","person_id":"yir_cmm_s73","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-098-jin033-wangji:head:m0265","start":265,"end":267,"surface":"杜蕤","kind":"person","person_id":"chl_ffi_e2k","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-098-jin033-wangji:head:m0268","start":268,"end":270,"surface":"魯瑤","kind":"person","person_id":"bse_0l6_t0v","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"}],"source_position":{"first_line":11,"last_line":11,"revision_id":2614273},"source_quote":{"witness":"j98","quote":"王敦，字處仲，司徒導之從父兄也。父基，治書侍御史。敦少有奇人之目，尚武帝女襄城公主，拜駙馬都尉，除太子舍人。時王愷、石崇以豪侈相尚，愷嘗置酒，敦與導俱在坐，有女伎吹笛小失聲韻，愷便驅殺之，一坐改容，敦神色自若。他日，又造愷，愷使美人行酒，以客飲不盡，輒殺之。酒至敦、導所，敦故不肯持，美人悲懼失色，而敦傲然不視。導素不能飲，恐行酒者得罪，遂勉強盡觴。導還，歎曰：「處仲若當世，心懷剛忍，非令終也。」洗馬潘滔見敦而目之曰：「處仲蜂目已露，但豺聲未振，若不噬人，亦當為人所噬。」及太子遷許昌，詔東宮官屬不得送。敦及洗馬江統、潘滔，舍人杜蕤、魯瑤等，冒禁于路側望拜流涕，時論稱之。遷給事黃門侍郎。","raw_start":226,"raw_end":521,"raw_line":11},"initial_excerpt":{"paragraph_id":"c-jinshu-098-jin033-wangji:head","start":0,"end":25,"surface":"王敦，字處仲，司徒導之從父兄也。父基，治書侍御史。"},"chapter_id":"c-jinshu-098-jin033-wangji","book_id":"b-jinshu-098","work_id":"w-jinshu","source_id":"s-jinshu-098-jin033-wangji"},{"id":"c-jinshu-098-jin033-wangji:line013","text":"趙王倫篡位，敦叔父彥為兗州刺史，倫遣敦慰勞之。會諸王起義兵；彥被齊王冏檄，懼倫兵強，不敢應命，敦勸彥起兵應諸王，故彥遂立勳績。惠帝反正，敦遷散騎常侍、左衛將軍、大鴻臚、侍中，出除廣武將軍、青州刺史。永嘉初，徵為中書監。于時天下大亂，敦悉以公主時侍婢百餘人配給將士，金銀寶物散之於眾，單車還洛。東海王越自滎陽來朝，敦謂所親曰：「今威權悉在太傅，而選用表情，尚書猶以舊制裁之，太傅今至，必有誅罰。」俄而越收中書令繆播等十餘人殺之。越以敦為揚州刺史，潘滔說越曰：「今樹處仲于江外，使其肆豪強之心，是見賊也。」越不從。其後徵拜尚書，不就。元帝召為安東軍諮祭酒。會揚州刺史劉陶卒，帝復以敦為揚州刺史，加廣武將軍。尋進左將軍、都督征討諸軍事、假節。帝初鎮江東，威名未著，敦與從弟導等同心翼戴，以隆中興，時人為之語曰：「王與馬，共天下。」尋與甘卓等討江州刺史華軼，斬之。","annotation_status":"reviewed","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-jinshu-098-jin033-wangji:line013:m0000","start":0,"end":3,"surface":"趙王倫","kind":"person","person_id":"dkn_ge4_286_AAAAG","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-098-jin033-wangji:line013:m0006","start":6,"end":7,"surface":"敦","kind":"person","person_id":"39o_b6y_n74","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-098-jin033-wangji:line013:m0009","start":9,"end":10,"surface":"彥","kind":"person","person_id":"7r6_k52_qji_ABE","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-098-jin033-wangji:line013:m0016","start":16,"end":17,"surface":"倫","kind":"person","person_id":"dkn_ge4_286_AAAAG","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-098-jin033-wangji:line013:m0018","start":18,"end":19,"surface":"敦","kind":"person","person_id":"39o_b6y_n74","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-098-jin033-wangji:line013:m0030","start":30,"end":31,"surface":"彥","kind":"person","person_id":"7r6_k52_qji_ABE","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-098-jin033-wangji:line013:m0032","start":32,"end":35,"surface":"齊王冏","kind":"person","person_id":"ee0_b2a_68e","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-098-jin033-wangji:line013:m0038","start":38,"end":39,"surface":"倫","kind":"person","person_id":"dkn_ge4_286_AAAAG","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-098-jin033-wangji:line013:m0047","start":47,"end":48,"surface":"敦","kind":"person","person_id":"39o_b6y_n74","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-098-jin033-wangji:line013:m0049","start":49,"end":50,"surface":"彥","kind":"person","person_id":"7r6_k52_qji_ABE","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-098-jin033-wangji:line013:m0057","start":57,"end":58,"surface":"彥","kind":"person","person_id":"7r6_k52_qji_ABE","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-098-jin033-wangji:line013:m0063","start":63,"end":65,"surface":"惠帝","kind":"person","person_id":"7e0_f69_1ac","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-098-jin033-wangji:line013:m0068","start":68,"end":69,"surface":"敦","kind":"person","person_id":"39o_b6y_n74","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-098-jin033-wangji:line013:m0116","start":116,"end":117,"surface":"敦","kind":"person","person_id":"39o_b6y_n74","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-098-jin033-wangji:line013:m0146","start":146,"end":150,"surface":"東海王越","kind":"person","person_id":"9o2_vhv_r7y","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-098-jin033-wangji:line013:m0156","start":156,"end":157,"surface":"敦","kind":"person","person_id":"39o_b6y_n74","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-098-jin033-wangji:line013:m0199","start":199,"end":200,"surface":"越","kind":"person","person_id":"9o2_vhv_r7y","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-098-jin033-wangji:line013:m0204","start":204,"end":206,"surface":"繆播","kind":"person","person_id":"yrw_hnh_9tu","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-098-jin033-wangji:line013:m0213","start":213,"end":214,"surface":"越","kind":"person","person_id":"9o2_vhv_r7y","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-098-jin033-wangji:line013:m0215","start":215,"end":216,"surface":"敦","kind":"person","person_id":"39o_b6y_n74","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-098-jin033-wangji:line013:m0222","start":222,"end":224,"surface":"潘滔","kind":"person","person_id":"yir_cmm_s73","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-098-jin033-wangji:line013:m0225","start":225,"end":226,"surface":"越","kind":"person","person_id":"9o2_vhv_r7y","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記